  <item>
    <title>《后会友期》04-05： 青稚白小纯泪海名场面， 王子璇执意去接文吉儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afad383fe62f8f52c4c0a71</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afad383fe62f8f52c4c0a71</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:17:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又《后会友期》了</span></p><p><span>这次攒了两期一起聊</span></p><p><span>第四期重点内容：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 青稚和白小纯的悬崖小屋对谈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 电竞圈的残酷和不作为</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 努力是不是一种天赋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> 张萌和马天宇 成年人的体面和敷衍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2537">42:17</a> 张萌和马天宇既是参与者又是观察嘉宾，造成的不良影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a> 王子璇还钱，不做朋友，再聊3万元写序事件，文吉儿和王子璇的表现</span></p><p><span>第五期重点内容：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4177">1:09:37</a> 为什么没有去医院的画面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> 马天宇提白小纯的原生家庭问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4675">1:17:55</a> 青稚泪海名场面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5149">1:25:49</a> 白小纯和王子璇的绯闻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5614">1:33:34</a> 青稚有没有传错文吉儿的话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5915">1:38:35</a> 文吉儿怎么回到的旅店，知不知道有车，为什么不打车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5995">1:39:55</a> 为啥王子璇执意去接文吉儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6519">1:48:39</a> 青稚表白文吉儿，删减的一些镜头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6835">1:53:55</a> 节目剪辑乱，观察室配置差，火是因为嘉宾，但制作得很草台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7087">1:58:07</a> 陈晓楠访问许飞和厉娜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7428">2:03:48</a> 许飞说以后也不要和厉娜做朋友了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8396">2:19:56</a> 选秀的残酷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8911">2:28:31</a> 《泪海许茹芸》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6722f24ffe1f6b35ae53a4fd/lsRiz8NbNEruQWxU_CU4UHcgAVre.m4a" length="143132995" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:33:30</itunes:duration>
