  <item>
    <title>《乘风2026（浪姐7）》决赛：姐姐们远走高飞，RYSL</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a429dde2e335a35a80b6a8e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a429dde2e335a35a80b6a8e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 16:53:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>乘风之夜，曾沛慈、张月、王濛、李小冉、孙怡、唐艺昕、萧蔷、李心洁、叶一茜、范玮琪、徐洁儿、安崎获得年度乘风席位，曾沛慈获总冠军，张月获年度队长，王濛获得乘风年度人物。</span></p><p><span>终于浪姐迎来了最后的决赛，12个成团席位还是让人吃惊，几乎所有人都在为陈瑶未成团感到惋惜</span></p><p><span>感谢大家的收听，这是我们关于《乘风2026》的最后一期</span></p><p><span>让我们一致地喊出RYSL</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 张月X-Leader跟王珞丹异曲同工</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 孙怡安慰未成团的陈瑶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 张月五公的翻盘剧本太过明显，全7季最高票，就为了决赛的年度队长做铺垫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1974">32:54</a> 曾沛慈夺冠实至名归，但她的老公有点坑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 乌兰图雅卡位13未成团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 陈瑶未成团，是服从性测试，是没接芒果给的剧本，从此被陷害</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 徐洁儿成团是实至名归</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> 网传叶一茜提前锁定成团名单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4083">01:08:03</a> 任洋应该是范玮琪的粉丝，他的年龄应该是看台湾综艺长大的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4551">01:15:51</a> 庄法一直是排名很靠后的，所以未成团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4852">01:20:52</a> 黄灿灿的人设</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5188">01:26:28</a>“慈安灿”超话关闭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5714">01:35:14</a> 王濛决赛获得乘风年度人物，是任洋对她内涵节目的报复</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6241">01:44:01</a> 李小冉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6482">01:48:02</a> 《独家记忆》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7419">02:03:39</a> 萧蔷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8431">02:20:31</a> 《那些花儿》</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6722f24ffe1f6b35ae53a4fd/lsE4eP4Fwmo0NYbBFViIAT1717u8.m4a" length="139009553" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:24:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJfUcn8SOr7eIP44L_hQtoezPFx.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《乘风2026（浪姐7）》四公：芒果，直播的KING</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a26ce0ab30e1571aea2cec2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a26ce0ab30e1571aea2cec2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 14:32:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>浪姐四公直播三天，都看了，聊得有点长，但还没聊全，没怎么说舞台</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 为什么说节目别办了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 把任洋换了，换成女导演节目就能好吗？刘乐和张丹阳就是很好的例子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 直播第一天团秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 张月组《锁》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> 曾沛慈团《Susan说》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a> 五公可能淘汰5个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3163">52:43</a> 唐艺昕团《胆小鬼》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> 王濛团《普通Disco》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3926">01:05:26</a> 是屁还是KING</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4108">01:08:28</a> 李心洁团《DNA》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4366">01:12:46</a> 直播第二天乘风跨团合作秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4547">01:15:47</a> 为什么陈瑶的排名越来越低</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4738">01:18:58</a>安崎高情商发言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4985">01:23:05</a> 谁是皇上皇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5390">01:29:50</a> 张月能获得什么奖项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5443">01:30:43</a> 瑶台月下什么时候能合体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5947">01:39:07</a> 万千惠全场最低分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6430">01:47:10</a> 谢娜，演唱会的king</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6695">01:51:35</a> 直播第三天乘风团内合作秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7008">01:56:48</a> 预测决赛的冠军和Xleader</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7608">02:06:48</a> 浪姐还要不要继续办</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8187">02:16:27</a> 《海屿你》李心洁/何宣林</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
