  <item>
    <title>《乘风2026（浪姐7）》阵容前瞻：真的是最糊的一届吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bd78e52d318777c9f1226c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bd78e52d318777c9f1226c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 17:11:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近有瓜主爆出了浪姐7的32人名单，网友称之为最糊的一届。阵容如下：萧蔷、李心洁、范玮琪、李小冉、赵子琪、温峥嵘、徐洁儿、谢楠、者来女、乌兰图雅、叶一茜、王濛、淡淡、曾沛慈、陶昕然、江语晨、唐艺昕、阚清子、庄法、侯宇、代斯、陈凯琳、何宣林、孙怡、万千惠、张慧雯、陈瑶、张月、徐梦洁、黄灿灿、张艺上、安崎 ​​​</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方宣传今年会以直播的形式播出，网传初舞台播出时间是4月3日，我们就先根据网传的阵容聊一下对本季姐姐的印象。有些姐姐确实不是很熟悉，也欢迎在评论区指正和补充。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 比去年的浪姐6播出得晚，今年主打直播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 目前豆瓣传出来的阵容比较保真，别的营销号都是搬运，之前传过李小璐和邓家佳，还有最离谱的张曼玉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 网传的32人名单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 期待并非《套马杆》原唱的乌兰图雅直播躲汉子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 台湾第一美女萧蔷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 《见鬼》金马金像双料影后李心洁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 隐隐约约有听说会来的范玮琪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 演过《海豚湾恋人》的徐洁儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 游戏达人李小冉和谢娜的过往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 你是温峥嵘，那谁在浪姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a> 《终极一班》的回忆杀曾沛慈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 人类早期土味情话，你是我的优乐美，江语晨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 被黎明误会的王濛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 谢楠早就知道龙虾有多厉害了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 和女儿雌竞的叶一茜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> 从央视春晚主持到豹纹阿姨赵子琪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a> 还没嘉行解约的代斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3029">50:29</a> 杨紫的同学，孟子义的班主任何宣林</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 参加过乘风2025总决赛的新生代京剧青年艺术家侯宇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3222">53:42</a> 阚清子最近演的乔海伦热度很高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3306">55:06</a> 上一季的舞台总监淡淡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3486">58:06</a> 很可能大火的陈瑶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3549">59:09</a> 最糊谋女郎张慧雯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3644">1:00:44</a> &nbsp;让罗志祥丢面子的张月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3908">1:05:08</a> 来天娱养老的安崎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4257">1:10:57</a> 热度高的秀人徐梦洁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4338">1:12:18</a> 梦回《甄嬛传》唐艺昕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4441">1:14:01</a> 梦回《甄嬛传》陶昕然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4482">1:14:42</a> 香港唯一代表陈凯琳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">1:15:45</a> 越南版《乘风破浪的姐姐》冠军庄法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4837">1:20:37</a> 以为来《再见爱人》，结果来浪姐的孙怡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4933">1:22:13</a> 出道很久，归来仍是武大校花的黄灿灿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5074">1:24:34</a> 被黄景瑜连累的张艺上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5226">1:27:06</a> 姐姐不想当家只想带货给老公养老的万千惠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5571">1:32:51</a> 马甲穿不完的者来女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5770">1:36:10</a> 预测今年的冠军：淡淡、李心洁、唐艺昕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6368">1:46:08</a> 我们已经帮任洋选好了成团的姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6824">1:53:44</a> 《自由》李心洁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6722f24ffe1f6b35ae53a4fd/lg54TCIs_eDPyI_SG7ieHy0sS9rk.m4a" length="113452279" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:57:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsrkkbm3MLc82r5jQPSs58CiOUDH.png"/>
